window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/resources/hpc-v26-007-c12e61f6f3d003cb.json"]={sha256:"c12e61f6f3d003cb75522b88dd74fd3cb667a0d16e266f061e934461cb43d166",value:{"sources":[{"id":"v26-case-ddbd13cf85295526","url":"https://global.fujitsu/en-global/technology/research/fugaku/specifications","title":"Fugaku specifications","titleEn":"Fugaku specifications","publisher":"Fujitsu","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"media":{"courses":[{"courseId":"hpc-v26-007","videos":[],"guides":[]}]},"related":{"courses":[{"courseId":"hpc-v26-007","related":[{"id":"hpc-v26-008","referenceUrls":["https://www.olcf.ornl.gov/olcf-resources/compute-systems/titan/"],"title":"Titan XK7：GPU 卸載的損益平衡","titleEn":"Titan XK7: GPU offload break-even","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：交付SVE述詞表、尾端哨兵測試與可攜性限制；13與25正確，所有尾端有效索引被寫一次、哨兵未修改；請另一位學徒依交付件重新推導一組；未通過或資料不足必須明記，不以品牌或峰值取代證據。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Deliver predicates, tail-sentinel tests and portability limits. Verify 13 and 25, each valid index written once and sentinels unchanged. Have another learner derive one case from the handover; label failures or missing evidence without substituting brand names or peak rates.","difference":"畫主機與裝置兩條泳道及資料所有權；標出計時開始與完成同步，避免只記enqueue；40/32可重建，等待涵蓋D2H完成，重用版本與CPU參考一致。","differenceEn":"Draw host/device lanes and data ownership, with timing start and completion synchronization rather than enqueue alone. Reproduce 40/32, wait through D2H and match reused versions to the CPU reference.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["FP64每元素64位元，L=VL/64；執行回合為ceil(N/L)，最後回合遮掉超出N的lane；合成N=100，教學VL512位元；對照VL256是可攜模型，並非更改Fugaku硬體；名義式 ceil(100/(512/64)) = 13 vector iterations；變更式 ceil(100/(256/64)) = 25 vector iterations。數據與驗收門檻為原創教學情境，並非所列超級電腦或函式庫的實測規格。","不重疊模型T=H2D+kernel+D2H+launch；比較完整路徑，不能只量GPU核函數；合成傳入12、核計算18、傳出8、啟動2毫秒；資料重用後傳入4，其他不變；CPU基準50；名義式 12+18+8+2 = 40 ms；變更式 4+18+8+2 = 32 ms。數據與驗收門檻為原創教學情境，並非所列超級電腦或函式庫的實測規格。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["FP64 lanes are L=VL/64; iterations are ceil(N/L), with out-of-range tail lanes masked. N = 100, VL = 512 bits; VL = 256 is a portability model, not a claim that Fugaku hardware is reconfigured. Nominal ceil(100/(512/64)) = 13 vector iterations; changed ceil(100/(256/64)) = 25 vector iterations. Inputs and acceptance thresholds are original teaching scenarios, not measured specifications of the named systems or libraries.","Without overlap, T=H2D+kernel+D2H+launch; compare complete paths rather than kernel-only timings. Synthetic H2D = 12, kernel 18, D2H = 8, launch 2 ms; reuse reduces H2D to 4; CPU baseline 50. Nominal 12+18+8+2 = 40 ms; changed 4+18+8+2 = 32 ms. Inputs and acceptance thresholds are original teaching scenarios, not measured specifications of the named systems or libraries.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]},{"id":"hpc-v26-017","referenceUrls":["https://docs.nersc.gov/systems/perlmutter/architecture/"],"title":"NUMA First-touch：資料放置與遠端讀取","titleEn":"NUMA first-touch: placement and remote reads","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：交付SVE述詞表、尾端哨兵測試與可攜性限制；13與25正確，所有尾端有效索引被寫一次、哨兵未修改；請另一位學徒依交付件重新推導一組；未通過或資料不足必須明記，不以品牌或峰值取代證據。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Deliver predicates, tail-sentinel tests and portability limits. Verify 13 and 25, each valid index written once and sentinels unchanged. Have another learner derive one case from the handover; label failures or missing evidence without substituting brand names or peak rates.","difference":"畫初始化執行緒、頁面歸屬與消費執行緒；first-touch不是程序建立時自動平均分散；95/86重現，頁面與工作映射可追蹤，未以延遲平均預測所有快取行為。","differenceEn":"Map initializer, page ownership and consuming threads; first-touch is not automatic even distribution at process creation. Reproduce 95/86 with traceable pages/work, without extending the average to all cache behavior.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["FP64每元素64位元，L=VL/64；執行回合為ceil(N/L)，最後回合遮掉超出N的lane；合成N=100，教學VL512位元；對照VL256是可攜模型，並非更改Fugaku硬體；名義式 ceil(100/(512/64)) = 13 vector iterations；變更式 ceil(100/(256/64)) = 25 vector iterations。數據與驗收門檻為原創教學情境，並非所列超級電腦或函式庫的實測規格。","平均延遲L=p×Llocal+(1−p)×Lremote，假設存取可分別計數且無重疊；本地80ns、遠端140ns；本地比例p=.75，改善到.9；名義式 .75*80+.25*140 = 95 ns/access model；變更式 .9*80+.1*140 = 86 ns/access model。數據與驗收門檻為原創教學情境，並非所列超級電腦或函式庫的實測規格。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["FP64 lanes are L=VL/64; iterations are ceil(N/L), with out-of-range tail lanes masked. N = 100, VL = 512 bits; VL = 256 is a portability model, not a claim that Fugaku hardware is reconfigured. Nominal ceil(100/(512/64)) = 13 vector iterations; changed ceil(100/(256/64)) = 25 vector iterations. Inputs and acceptance thresholds are original teaching scenarios, not measured specifications of the named systems or libraries.","Average latency L=pLlocal+(1−p)Lremote, assuming countable independent accesses with no overlap. Local 80 ns, remote 140 ns; local share 0.75 then 0.9. Nominal .75*80+.25*140 = 95 ns/access model; changed .9*80+.1*140 = 86 ns/access model. Inputs and acceptance thresholds are original teaching scenarios, not measured specifications of the named systems or libraries.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]}],"references":[{"id":"v26-case-16b82093b98b84bf","url":"https://www.olcf.ornl.gov/olcf-resources/compute-systems/titan/","title":"Titan system overview and retirement","titleEn":"Titan system overview and retirement","publisher":"Oak Ridge Leadership Computing Facility","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v26-case-d7f277d87e1f4f91","url":"https://docs.nersc.gov/systems/perlmutter/architecture/","title":"Perlmutter CPU architecture","titleEn":"Perlmutter CPU architecture","publisher":"NERSC","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"overview":"比較相鄰案例與另一組案例的模型、可量測結果及可轉移的驗證方法。","overviewEn":"Compare neighboring and cross-group cases by model, measurable outcome, and transferable verification method."}]},"places":{"courses":[]},"vendors":{"courses":[],"vendors":[]}}};
